      "section": "cards",
      "rank": 72,
      "title": "Amex 35% Membership Rewards transfer bonus to Marriott reported for targeted members",
      "summary": "Doctor of Credit reports that some American Express members are being targeted for a 35% transfer bonus from Membership Rewards to Marriott. A transfer of 1,000 Membership Rewards points would yield 1,350 Marriott points instead of the usual 1,000. The promotion is reported to run through December 10, 2026, and is targeted rather than publicly available. The offer has not been officially confirmed.",
      "verification": "reported",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-10-25T19:50:28.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "publisher": "Doctor of Credit",
          "url": "https://www.doctorofcredit.com/american-express-transfer-bonus-35-to-marriott-11-35-2/",
          "sourceType": "editorial",
          "publishedAt": "2026-10-25T19:50:28.000Z",
          "retrievedAt": "2026-10-26T14:01:55.684Z"
        }
      ],
      "terms": {
        "issuer": "American Express",
        "program": "Membership Rewards",
        "merchant": "Marriott",
        "rewardType": "points",
        "minSpend": null,
        "creditAmount": null,
        "rewardPoints": 1350,
        "activationRequired": null,
        "activateBy": null
      },
      "expiresAt": "2026-12-10T23:59:59.000Z",
      "firstSeenAt": "2026-10-26T14:03:09.508Z",
      "changedAt": "2026-10-26T14:03:09.508Z",
      "sourceRunId": "b599ddd6-a1a6-4e59-aacd-6805f17dda6a",
      "changeType": "new",
      "active": true,
      "paragraphs": [
        "The bonus is account-specific, according to Doctor of Credit, so it may not appear for every American Express cardholder. The promotion changes the standard 1:1 transfer ratio to 1:1.35 for eligible members through December 10, 2026.",
        "Doctor of Credit notes that Marriott transfer bonuses have varied in prior years, including a 35% bonus in late 2025 and a 20% bonus in 2023. The publisher cautions that the bonus may not be compelling relative to the value of Membership Rewards points."
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Targeted at some American Express members; not all accounts may see the offer.",
        "1,000 Membership Rewards points converts to 1,350 Marriott points under the promotion.",
        "Reported deadline is December 10, 2026."
      ],
      "takeaway": "Check your Amex Membership Rewards transfer page for Marriott before December 10, 2026. If the 35% bonus is not shown, your account likely is not targeted."
    }
